{
  "id": "6a7546ec9960c79c19e426c1",
  "title": "医療の進歩",
  "created": 1786070767,
  "updated": 1786073719,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a7546ec9960c79c19e426c1",
      "text": "医療の進歩",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1786070767,
      "updated": 1786070767
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7546ef00000000008b3f99",
      "text": " 医療技術の進歩",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1786070767,
      "updated": 1786070775
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7546f600000000008b3f9b",
      "text": " それにキャッチアップする医療従事者",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1786070775,
      "updated": 1786070800
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75471600000000008b3f9c",
      "text": " 両者が揃って初めて医療の進歩を享受できると言えそう",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1786070806,
      "updated": 1786070841
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7552100000000000da9822",
      "text": "\t新たな手技の習得",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1786073617,
      "updated": 1786073712
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75526f0000000000da9828",
      "text": "\t新しい薬",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1786073712,
      "updated": 1786073719
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7546f200000000008b3f9a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1786070771,
      "updated": 1786070771
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7551f50000000000da9820",
      "text": "\t下のようなことを考えて気休め？にすることがある",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1786073590,
      "updated": 1786073596
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7551c80000000000da981a",
      "text": " \t10年前と比べてどれくらい医療が進歩しているのだろう？",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1786073545,
      "updated": 1786073601
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7552000000000000da9821",
      "text": " \t\t注射が痛くないとか薄毛の薬の効果が上がっているとか",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1786073601,
      "updated": 1786073601
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7551cc0000000000da981b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1786073549,
      "updated": 1786073549
    }
  ]
}